2026-09-23T17:00:23.6046005Z     The ``pytest`` framework makes it easy to write small tests, yet
2026-09-23T17:00:23.6046226Z     scales to support complex functional testing for applications and libraries.
2026-09-23T17:00:23.6046304Z     
2026-09-23T17:00:23.6046400Z     An example of a simple test:
2026-09-23T17:00:23.6046473Z     
2026-09-23T17:00:23.6046572Z     .. code-block:: python
